{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2075510/extras/c2b7970218f80a966994b041f6e12a38.poster.avif?t=1763458151\" width=620 height=120 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2075510/extras/c2b7970218f80a966994b041f6e12a38.webm?t=1763458151\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2075510/extras/c2b7970218f80a966994b041f6e12a38.mp4?t=1763458151\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Aixin: Goddess\u2019 Love is a short visual novel about the intertwined destinies of a goddess and a warrior in a world inspired by ancient Chinese mythology.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Aixin</strong></i> is a young goddess whose purity and virtue seem boundless.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Wen Yang</strong></i> is a seasoned warrior whose past has left him deeply scarred.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An unexpected event becomes a test, forcing both to doubt eternal truths. What is stronger: duty or feeling? Can love atone for sins? And what will remain when all principles collapse?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2075510/extras/215fbfde8f6b16fa0c806e691a91bcc2.avif?t=1763458151\" width=620 height=113 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Short story (6800 words).\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One decisive choice that determines the ending. Two alternative endings.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We\u2019ve tried to create a charming audiovisual atmosphere that will highlight the drama of this story.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Bad ending","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2075510/1a7999c0dacdc2a19b86221160e2df042d5e1e28.jpg"},{"name":"Good ending","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2075510/3f708161b6e28230880507d1b6be73f5cfa51737.jpg"}],"total":2},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2075510?t=1763458151","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2075510/5a9ec1b6581d9b10804d331548996fd479c67501/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1763458151","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2075510/40f108b015ab3f15209ad533797bd71ee9060ff8/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1763458151","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2075510/40f108b015ab3f15209ad533797bd71ee9060ff8/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1763458151","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":4029040,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2075510/extras/c2b7970218f80a966994b041f6e12a38.poster.avif?t=1763458151\" width=620 height=120 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2075510/extras/c2b7970218f80a966994b041f6e12a38.webm?t=1763458151\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2075510/extras/c2b7970218f80a966994b041f6e12a38.mp4?t=1763458151\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Aixin: Goddess\u2019 Love is a short visual novel about the intertwined destinies of a goddess and a warrior in a world inspired by ancient Chinese mythology.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Aixin</strong></i> is a young goddess whose purity and virtue seem boundless.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Wen Yang</strong></i> is a seasoned warrior whose past has left him deeply scarred.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An unexpected event becomes a test, forcing both to doubt eternal truths. What is stronger: duty or feeling? Can love atone for sins? And what will remain when all principles collapse?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2075510/extras/215fbfde8f6b16fa0c806e691a91bcc2.avif?t=1763458151\" width=620 height=113 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Short story (6800 words).\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One decisive choice that determines the ending. Two alternative endings.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We\u2019ve tried to create a charming audiovisual atmosphere that will highlight the drama of this story.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p>","developers":["7th Ascension"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2075510/4322fbd84b1dab646ac9d976cd1a8cec6436e74e/header.jpg?t=1763458151","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</stro